{"worker": "forge", "role": "code_drafter", "model": "codellama:13b", "task": "Draft a 15-line GDScript patch to add WASD camera pan to /home/ross/qsb_godot_native_cockpit/scripts/v2/Main_v2.gd. The Main_v2 has camera_controller (CameraController) with a look_target Vector3. Each frame, increment look_target.x/z by 0.5 * delta * direction when WASD pressed. Output ONLY the patch.", "reply": "```diff\ndiff --git a/scripts/v2/Main_v2.gd b/scripts/v2/Main_v2.gd\nindex fc34b09..57681a7 100644\n--- a/scripts/v2/Main_v2.gd\n+++ b/scripts/v2/Main_v2.gd\n@@ -1,6 +1,15 @@\n extends Node\n\n var camera_controller = null\n+var wasd_pressed = false\n+var look_target = Vector3(0, 0, 0)\n+var direction = Vector3(0, 0, 0)\n\n func _ready():\n   camera_controller = get_node(\"CameraController\")\n+  Input.connect(\"key_pressed\", self, \"_on_key_pressed\")\n+  Input.connect(\"key_released\", self, \"_on_key_released\")\n\n@@ -12,6 +19,7 @@ func _process(delta):\n   camera_controller.look_target = look_target\n\n+func _on_key_pressed(event):\n+  if event.scancode == KEY_W:\n+    direction.z += 0.5 * delta\n+  elif event.scancode == KEY_A:\n+    direction.x -= 0.5 * delta\n+  elif event.scancode == KEY_S:\n+    direction.z -= 0.5 * delta\n+  elif event.scancode == KEY_D:\n+    direction.x += 0.5 * delta\n```", "wall_s": 16.73, "ts": "2026-06-15T08:22:10Z"}
